('fc2ab773-9e5e-4416-80d2-e40bf0bc0e06'::uuid, 'Aramay', 'player'::public.character_kind, null, (select id from public.class_templates where class_key = 'talismanist' limit 1), 'talismanist', 'Talismanist', 1, 125, 125, 100, 100, 10, 0, '{"range":0,"agility":0,"alchemy":-1,"stealth":-2,"accuracy":1,"charisma":0,"recovery":0,"strength":1,"vitality":1,"mana_regen":0,"perception":0,"intelligence":1}'::jsonb, '["Begins with three random low-level runes.","Requires only three runes to force a spell into a weapon instead of five; additional runes improve the result.","Each spell-infused weapon on hand can cast its spell twice per combat."]'::jsonb, 'Unique Spell: “Shards of Stillness”
creates formations of dark ice, the size and shape of which depends on how many “stasis charges” are consumed
-1 “stasis charge”: small crystal, detonates on hit (10 AoE damage, can chain react to detonate up to 2 other crystals in one cycle)

*No more than 3 small crystals can be created in one cycle

-2 “stasis charges”: large crystal that can block attacks, detonates on taking damage twice (deals 20 Aoe damage, cannot chain react, cannot hit allies)

-4 “stasis charges”: forms ice around Aramay, granting an ice shield that gives 20 temporary hit points and full movement OR 30 temporary HP and movement is halved. The effect does not stack; recasting refreshes shield HP

-6 “stasis charges”: creates a wall of dark ice crystals with 30 HP

Unique Passive: Aramay controls an ancient magic form of ice that forms on her command

when landing a successful non magic attack, roll a D6. if the result is not a 1 or 2, Aramay gains 1 “stasis charge”. max of 1 charge gained per turn

max of 10 charges held at once', '#1c55ff', 'Calostrynn', 'Jericho')
